{"id":"imposible","lemma":"imposible","pos":"adj","rank":574,"glosses":["impossible","unable","out of the question"],"ipa":"/impoˈsible/","forms":{"femininePlural":"imposibles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-imposible.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sé que es imposible.","en":"I know it's impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459252"},{"text":"Los terremotos son imposibles de predecir.","en":"It's impossible to predict earthquakes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689007"},{"text":"Es imposible que funcione.","en":"It can't possibly work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461541"},{"text":"Se pensaba que los viajes espaciales eran imposibles.","en":"Space travel was thought to be impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/931352"},{"text":"Es imposible para mí.","en":"It's impossible for me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461603"}]}